  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank Pioneer Outcomes Fund to improve Learning Outcomes for children in Ghana and Pakistan, supporting out of school children to enter the school system and continue learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity World Bank Pioneer Outcomes Fund to improve Learning Outcomes for children in Ghana and Pakistan, supporting out of school children to enter the school system and continue learning is a component of POF - Pioneer Outcomes Funds reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;16,052,326. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Primary education, Public sector policy and administrative management, Educational research.</narrative>
  </description>
